  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm]\nOur father\nthy will be done\n[D5]\n\n[Verse 1]\nI have denied\nthis life its worth\nI will not\nbe the victim\n\n[Chorus]\n[A#7M]Sickness to you\nmy master\n[D5]  [Dsus2]\n[D5]Here's to [Dsus2]getting worse\n[A#7M]Hope it kills\nyou faster\n[D5]  [Dsus2]\n[D5]Show me [Dsus2]how it hurts\n[Dm/F]to rot from the\ninside out\n[Dm/E]This vigil burns\nuntil the day\n[Dm/Eb]our fires over-\ntake you.\nOur father we\nforsake you.\n\n[Bridge 1]\n[D5]\nBlessed be his name\nNothing now the same\n\n[Interlude 1]\n[D5]\n\n[Break]\n[D5]\n[E5]  [F5]  [E5]\n[E5]  [F5]  [E5]\n[E5]  [F5]  [E5]\n[E5]  [F5]  [E5]\nnue\n\n[Bridge 2]\n[D5]\nI de-\nfy you to conti-\nnue\nIn\n\n[Interlude 2]\n[E5]honor of [F5]the strife [E5]of those\nwho've died In gene-\n[E5]rations [F5]before [E5]your blood\nstained glory I re-\n[E5]ject you [F5][E5]I de-\nny you I de-\n[E5]fy you [F5]to [E5]conti-\nnue.\n\n[Outro]\n[D5]\nSmite the\nshepherd\nand the\nsheep\nwill be\nscat-\ntered",
